{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Z2rdIjRXFk1794565985.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產西九龍美孚萬事達第三分行分區營業經理馮健平表示，中原最新促成一宗美孚新邨成交，單位為1期百老匯街6號中層C室，實用面積1022平方呎，採三房套房間隔，望公園景，放盤罕有，放盤短短5小時，即以1112萬元沽出，折合實用呎價10881元。<br/>中原地產馮健平指，上址原業主於1999年6月以423萬元購入上址，持貨27年，是次沽出單位賬可獲利689萬元，單位期內升值逾1.6倍。。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T11:37:01.051997+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":190,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T10:32:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T14:28:50.824379+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T11:30:27.393913+00:00","content_hash":"c19812a99fae59ec47db8843b51897afff27ff00195103ce76921759e4a7f6f9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T11:37:01.051997+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}